# symbanta-dashboard — development defaults
#
# The Vite dev server mounts the mock API (see `mock-api/`) at `/mock-api`, so
# `npm run dev` works with no backend at all. To talk to a real API instead:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.symbanta.jointhefreeworld.org npm run dev
#
# or start the standalone mock (`npm run mock:api`) and point the client at it:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787 npm run dev
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/mock-api
